   "Step 1 parts were correct; none added or dropped.",
   "Circuit: pin 9 -> orange wire -> breadboard column 4 -> 220 ohm resistor (4 to 6) -> LED anode (column 6). The LED cathode (column 8) goes by the black wire to GND, as in the manual text and schematic.",
